  "description": "Preview. fastino/gliner2-base-v1 (revision f9634218, GLiNER2 2.0.0) English entity extraction with labels and a threshold on ONNX Runtime: GLiNER2's Python text semantics (normalization, word splitter, lower-casing) and schema prefix through the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers: no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers, no native tokenizer), one ONNX graph, GLiNER2's span decoding, offsets into the original text. Ships the asset lock, not the weights; acquire them explicitly. Profile gliner2-base-v1/onnx-fp32-cpu (Linux x64, experimental). The application adds the ONNX Runtime native package.",
